const TAB='Orders';const HEADERS=['orderId','createdAt','name','phone','address','province','postcode','itemsText','itemsJson','total','status','note'];function doGet(e){if(e.parameter.action!=='listOrders')return out({ok:true,service:'Honey House'});if(!auth(e.parameter.token))return out({ok:false,error:'Unauthorized'});const rows=sheet().getDataRange().getValues().slice(1).filter(r=>r[0]).reverse().map(r=>({orderId:r[0],createdAt:r[1],name:r[2],phone:r[3],address:r[4],province:r[5],postcode:r[6],itemsText:r[7],itemsJson:r[8],total:r[9],status:r[10],note:r[11]}));return out({ok:true,orders:rows})}function doPost(e){try{const b=JSON.parse(e.postData.contents||'{}');if(b.action==='createOrder')return create(b);if(b.action==='updateStatus'){if(!auth(b.token))return out({ok:false,error:'Unauthorized'});const s=sheet(),v=s.getDataRange().getValues();for(let i=1;i<v.length;i++)if(v[i][0]===b.orderId){s.getRange(i+1,11).setValue(b.status);return out({ok:true})}return out({ok:false,error:'ไม่พบคำสั่งซื้อ'})}return out({ok:false,error:'Unknown action'})}catch(err){return out({ok:false,error:String(err)})}}function create(b){if(!b.name||!b.phone||!b.address||!b.province||!/^\\d{5}$/.test(String(b.postcode))||!Array.isArray(b.items)||!b.items.length)return out({ok:false,error:'ข้อมูลคำสั่งซื้อไม่ครบ'});const catalog={'HH-001':{name:'น้ำผึ้งดอกไม้ป่า',price:189},'HH-002':{name:'น้ำผึ้งดอกลำไย',price:229}},items=[];for(const x of b.items){const p=catalog[x.sku],q=Number(x.qty);if(!p||!Number.isInteger(q)||q<1||q>50)return out({ok:false,error:'รายการสินค้าไม่ถูกต้อง'});items.push({sku:x.sku,name:p.name,price:p.price,qty:q})}const total=items.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.price*x.qty,0),id='HH'+Utilities.formatDate(new Date(),'Asia/Bangkok','yyMMddHHmmss')+'-'+Math.floor(Math.random()*900+100),text=items.map(x=>x.name+' x '+x.qty).join(', ');const lock=LockService.getScriptLock();lock.waitLock(10000);try{sheet().appendRow([id,new Date(),b.name,b.phone,b.address,b.province,String(b.postcode),text,JSON.stringify(items),total,'รอชำระเงิน',b.note||''])}finally{lock.releaseLock()}return out({ok:true,orderId:id})}function sheet(){const ss=SpreadsheetApp.getActiveSpreadsheet();let s=ss.getSheetByName(TAB);if(!s){s=ss.insertSheet(TAB);s.appendRow(HEADERS);s.setFrozenRows(1)}return s}function auth(t){const key=PropertiesService.getScriptProperties().getProperty('ADMIN_TOKEN');return !!key&&t===key}function out(o){return ContentService.createTextOutput(JSON.stringify(o)).setMimeType(ContentService.MimeType.JSON)}